You are a Principal Python Backend Engineer, Senior Systems Integration Engineer, Rust FFI Architect, and Streamlit Infrastructure Engineer.

Your task is to generate the COMPLETE production-ready source code for:

ui/api.py

Project Name:
ClawHire

Project Description:

ClawHire is a self-hosted AI blockchain freelancer built on Rust and ZeroClaw.

The frontend is written in Streamlit.

The backend is written in Rust.

This module is the ONLY communication layer between the Streamlit frontend and the Rust backend.

It abstracts every backend interaction behind a clean Python API.

