Generate COMPLETE production-ready code.

Do NOT generate placeholders.

Do NOT generate TODO comments.

Do NOT generate pseudo code.

Everything must work.

Python Version

3.13+

Follow PEP8.

Use type hints.

Use dataclasses.

Use asyncio.

Use pathlib.

Use subprocess.

Use httpx.

Use requests only if absolutely necessary.

Use pydantic v2.

Use loguru.

Use cachetools.

Use tenacity.

Use typing.

Use uuid.

Use datetime.

No business logic.

No Streamlit UI.

No CSS.

Only backend communication.

